       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Fødselsnummer for the patient. Fødselsnummer as one of the possible patient identifier, should at least be sent unless there is a reason not to. Reasons for not sending the Fødselsnummer include but are not limited to, research and apps without a contract for processing data.\r\n\r\nMultiple FNR can exist for a person. If several FNR is provided the time period that each identifier is valid should be provided. No information about period is required when only one FNR is provided." ] ;
