       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "The purpose of this address.\r\n\r\nMapping of values to other Norwegian CodeSystems is documented in the implementation guide. In general the address used for visiting the person should have use \"home\" and type \"physical\" or \"both\". The \"official\" flag can be either true or false." ] ;
